      "writtenOn": "2025-01-21T19:26:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ByteStringView\u0027s (StringViewTemplate\u0027s, really) ctor that deduces length has a reinterpret_cast(), which the compiler disallows in constexpr code. I think to avoid that, StringViewTemplate will need to change its storage from UnsignedType to CharType.",
      "parentUuid": "9b6a5ecd_1c912dcb",
      "revId": "748122cd7ad72da5165180718c76417d13d40edb",
      "serverId": "fca2d64a-0420-3532-b200-12848c95a47b"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
