      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-21T19:28:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, the kConstant can be constexpr char[], and we just introduce a const ByteStringView local(kConstant) and use local.size().",
      "parentUuid": "f6c9e6d9_1567cb4c",
      "revId": "748122cd7ad72da5165180718c76417d13d40edb",
      "serverId": "fca2d64a-0420-3532-b200-12848c95a47b"
    },
