      "side": 1,
      "message": "Alas, `static constexpr auto s \u003d byte_span_from_cstring(\"hello\");` doesn\u0027t compile. The `constexpr auto byte_span_from_cstring(...);` signature gave false hope.\n\nGoing to try with https://pdfium-review.googlesource.com/131215, and it would also be preferable to just write `ByteStringView(\"foo\")` and not have to use the `u8` prefix.",
